{"seq":2,"slug":"logistics","title":"供应链物流管理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/logistics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"inventory-management-optimization","title":"库存管理与优化策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/logistics/inventory-management-optimization","wordCount":1619,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"warehouse-distribution-network","title":"仓配网络与分销设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/logistics/warehouse-distribution-network","wordCount":1389,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"transportation-freight-management","title":"运输与货运管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/logistics/transportation-freight-management","wordCount":1515,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"供应链物流管理\">供应链物流管理</h1><p>本章聚焦供应链的物理执行层——库存、仓储与运输。供应链战略再宏大，最终都要通过这三个环节把正确的商品在正确的时间送达正确的地点。</p>\n<p>库存管理决定&quot;备多少&quot;、仓配网络设计决定&quot;放在哪&quot;、运输管理决定&quot;怎么送&quot;。三者相互耦合：安全库存水位影响仓储空间需求，仓网布局影响运输成本与时效，而运输可靠性又反过来决定安全库存应设多高。</p>\n<p>本章不重复电商物流 hub 中关于末端配送和逆向物流的内容，而是站在供应链整体视角讨论库存策略、仓网拓扑和干线运输的系统性决策。</p>\n"}